format session-log-v1
stamp 20260821.002546
editor Claude Code
model claude-opus-5
voice Kyri
host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan ladder fold I -- the staircase the accessors already reached
prompt Pick up the running thread, close open agent-closable reds first, then take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first; read one council-rota doc; sweep the prose Radiant; send.
think Read Kyri and Radiant Style first, then the operator card, then the three newest session-log rows. The running thread is the Caravan ladder fold arc, folds A through H, and fold H's own recommend named the next crux precisely: tell_desist_tail at fifty-two lines in eight rungs and tell_beckon_own at thirty-four to a hundred and eleven in seven, both reading tiers through raw nesting written at a different depth in every rung.
think Reds first. The living REDS pin holds rows 101 and 102, both CLOSED on the last lap, and rows 81, 83, 84, 98 each carry their closure note. Nothing agent-closable stood open, so the constructive queue was clear to open.
think Sized the crux before touching it, because fold H's own lesson is that the verification cost comes first. tell_desist_tail stands in 8 rungs at 52 lines apiece, all eight hashing differently. Two things vary -- the pair of words naming which plan each column reports, and the depth of the raw nesting reaching three tiers.
think Read the whole cost before a line moved. Mapped each rung's raw nesting depth against its own accessor table, and every one of the three tiers the body reaches -- sufficing, reopening, reweighing -- already had an accessor standing at exactly that depth. Six symbols reached in all, and all six already stood pub across all eight rungs. The fold widened nothing.
think Proved the collapse before writing it. Substituted each rung's accessors for its raw nesting, masked the pair of words, and hashed: all eight bodies came out c5afe9dd1f7f. Seven of eight were then identical outright; desist differed in one more thing, its trailing hop naming tell_desist_own where the other seven name tell_beckon_own.
think Chose to leave the trailing hop in the rung's own delegate rather than widen tell_beckon_own to pub in seven rungs or reach for @field indirection. The hop is the staircase's own hinge and it stays written where each rung writes it -- fold F's lesson, and this time it costs one line of delegate rather than eight widenings.
think Captured the before-state on metal: built all eight rungs cold and ran them, 312 to 369 lines of printed output each. Then folded, rebuilt, reran, and compared line for line.
think The comparison differed only in client_a/b/c interleave lines, so I proved rather than assumed it -- ran one unfolded binary twice and it disagreed with itself by 14 lines where the fold's largest disagreement was 16 and abate's was 10. The interleave is the run. Every rung's sorted multiset is identical and non-client diffs are zero across all eight.
think Updated the printing meter to what was measured rather than to what the fold predicted, and tightened the ceiling 3,700 to 3,500, sized to catch the second rung written before the fold rather than the tenth.
obs The whole cost of this fold was zero widening -- six of six symbols already public in all eight rungs. That is fold F and fold G compounding: F widened one accessor by hand across 28 rungs, G found all eighteen of its symbols already public because of it, and I found all six the same way. The habit of publishing an accessor when you write it is what made this lap cheap.
obs The two rows a lift could most easily have inflated stood still for the sixth fold running -- the byte-identical check carry at 47 and the orchestration spine at 0. A cost removed rather than traded.
obs The neighbor walk's gap narrowed for the first time in three laps, 718 to 585, by the same mechanism that widened it before: the walk orders rungs by file length, so a fold that shrinks eight rungs by forty-nine lines apiece moves its own pairing. Widening and narrowing are one property seen twice, rather than two findings. Eighteen percent sits inside the stated twenty-one, so the bound did not have to move -- which is what a bound sized honestly last lap buys.
obs tell_beckon_own is not the same kind of body and I declined to fold it in the same lap. Its length is content rather than depth: each rung walks up to its own tier and prints the tiers it owns, so farewell stands at 34 lines and refrain at 111 because refrain owns more tiers. That wants a prefix/suffix split measured on its own, not a mask.
obs PRINT_BODIES rose 213 to 214 while carried lines fell 202. A fold that replaces eight long bodies with eight short delegates plus one harness body adds a body and removes lines -- the two numbers moving opposite ways is the meter reading honestly, rather than a fault.
loom witness=caravan_ladder_print_witness carried_before=3433 carried_after=3231 total_before=5848 total_after=5522 ceiling_before=3700 ceiling_after=3500
loom fold=I rungs=8 lines_deleted=392 lines_of_call=8 harness_lines=66 symbols_reached=6 symbols_widened=0
loom witness=caravan_suite_witness rungs=98 verdict=green wall_s=341
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the desisting telling's last movement stands once, over a comptime rung and its two words, reaching three tiers through each rung's own accessor
file caravan/abate.rye the fifty-two-line body becomes a four-line delegate keeping its own words and its own next hop
file caravan/answer.rye same delegate, words leaving/hearing
file caravan/beckon.rye same delegate, words keeping/beckoning
file caravan/conclude.rye same delegate, words leaving/concluding
file caravan/desist.rye same delegate, words relaying/bounding, and the one rung whose next hop is its own
file caravan/farewell.rye same delegate, words quiet/parting
file caravan/refrain.rye same delegate, words calling/refraining
file caravan/respect.rye same delegate, words reopening/respecting
file tools/caravan_ladder_print_witness.rish the meter pinned to what this lap measured, with the narrowing gap named rather than smoothed
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_print_scan.sh ceiling tightened 3,700 to 3,500 so the fold stays folded
recommend keep-going the deeper staircase remains and wants its own measurement first. tell_beckon_own stands in 7 rungs from 34 to 111 lines, and its length is content rather than depth -- each rung walks up to the tiers it owns. Count the shared prefix against the per-rung suffix before proposing a shape, since a mask cannot reach a body whose line count is the thing that varies. The seventy-line ratchet already names it twice, refrain at 111 and respect at 102, so the fold and the ratchet want the same lap.
